                                "sense_id": "e488782d-dfe0-3204-a6c7-91496500918b",
                                "text": "Full of Coxon's trademark sarky lyricism, this 14-track concept album celebrates and laments the bittersweet nature of love, avoiding being dull or mawkish by being so gorgeous and satisfyingly coherent."
