                                "sense_id": "e488782d-dfe0-3204-a6c7-91496500918b",
                                "text": "It would seem that during his Bournemouth team’s recent 2-1 defeat at Sheffield United, referee Jon Moss gave the hosts some “soft fouls” and made “little sarky comments” that “didn’t help”."
